1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,500
A quick tour of Quilvar — your clipboard history, with precision.

2
00:00:04,500 --> 00:00:10,000
Everything you copy is saved automatically — text and images.

3
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:15,500
Search your history, then click any clip to copy it again.

4
00:00:15,500 --> 00:00:21,000
Pin the clips you reuse. Pinned clips survive Clear All.

5
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:27,000
Group pinned clips into Quivers — folders for the snippets you reach for most.

6
00:00:27,000 --> 00:00:33,000
Quilvert cleans up text: trim, collapse whitespace, prettify or minify JSON.

7
00:00:33,000 --> 00:00:39,000
Quilvault keeps sensitive clips behind a PIN, encrypted on your device.

8
00:00:39,000 --> 00:00:45,000
Press Shift + Alt + V anywhere to open Quick Draw.

9
00:00:45,000 --> 00:00:51,000
Pick a clip with ↑ ↓ and hit Enter — it pastes straight into the app you were in.

10
00:00:51,000 --> 00:00:57,000
In Settings: change the shortcut, launch at startup, and check for updates.

11
00:00:57,000 --> 00:01:02,000
Everything stays on your device. Nothing is ever sent to a server.

